The sets list nothing of GCC: comp/gcc.amd64 (ld.bfd) and comp/mi's gcc-local.1 are gone.

EmiBSD's compiler is DevTools' LLVM and nothing GPL is in the system (README, Rules): GNU's
ld.bfd and GCC's local manual have no place in it (the user's decision of 2026-11-08, to
drop what the inherited toolchain left behind).

